{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a long forgotten kingdom, a hero sent to rescue a princess from an evil lord's castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What can go wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guards vs Goats is a first-person, linear, medieval FPS, with a touch of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once upon a time, in a forgotten land, in a forgotten era, there was a kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The kingdom was living in peace and prosperity. A peace and prosperity which made the lords of the realm bored and greedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When blood and war against neighboring kingdoms was lacking in their daily lives, the lords decided to fight among themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Times like these called a hero. A different... kind of hero...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are William but the realm knows you as mercenary called &quot;Goat&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will be summoned by the lords of the realm to perform their &quot;lordly&quot; tasks in return of\u00a0 some gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First person, linear, action playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every chapter consists of one or more of the following modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slower paced dungeon crawler levels, where you explore castles and dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast paced horde-mode levels where you  fight your way out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Escape scenes.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Selectable sword-fight mechanics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Timing based combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Directional combat.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 castles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom chapters. Create your own custom chapter according to the following:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each completed castle, or castle part will be unlocked for custom chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select the game mode you want to play in the custom chapter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rescue the princess.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the treasure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Escape.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extra gold you find in the story mode will help you unlock heroes to join you to custom chapters.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play chapter 1 out of the 10 chapters of the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3348120?t=1751403298","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3348120?t=1751403298","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348120/c8b5fd9c9067a96ab680767b729705effe079a92/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751403298","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348120/c8b5fd9c9067a96ab680767b729705effe079a92/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751403298","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Includes blood, death, stealing, revealing outfits, occasional curse words and insinuated consumption of alcohol."},"demos":[{"appid":3474270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a long forgotten kingdom, a hero sent to rescue a princess from an evil lord's castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What can go wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guards vs Goats is a first-person, linear, medieval FPS, with a touch of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once upon a time, in a forgotten land, in a forgotten era, there was a kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The kingdom was living in peace and prosperity. A peace and prosperity which made the lords of the realm bored and greedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When blood and war against neighboring kingdoms was lacking in their daily lives, the lords decided to fight among themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Times like these called a hero. A different... kind of hero...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are William but the realm knows you as mercenary called &quot;Goat&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will be summoned by the lords of the realm to perform their &quot;lordly&quot; tasks in return of\u00a0 some gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First person, linear, action playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every chapter consists of one or more of the following modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slower paced dungeon crawler levels, where you explore castles and dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast paced horde-mode levels where you  fight your way out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Escape scenes.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Selectable sword-fight mechanics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Timing based combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Directional combat.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 castles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom chapters. Create your own custom chapter according to the following:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each completed castle, or castle part will be unlocked for custom chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select the game mode you want to play in the custom chapter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rescue the princess.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the treasure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Escape.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extra gold you find in the story mode will help you unlock heroes to join you to custom chapters.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play chapter 1 out of the 10 chapters of the game.</p>","developers":["David Amado"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348120/header.jpg?t=1751403298","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257091955,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091955/movie480.mp4?t=1737745929","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091955/movie_max.mp4?t=1737745929"},"name":"Guards vs Goats Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257091955/354af70cfa0f01f8fd3992819bac3e1c79b560af/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1737745929","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091955/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1737745929","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091955/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1737745929"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257134086,"m